       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-THIN-SWIGLU.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-THIN-SWIGLU-PROOFS.
           05  WS-O1-LUT-LOOKUP-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FLAT-DATA-MEMBER-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ZERO-RECURSION-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SUB-MICROSEC-LATENCY-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-THIN-SWIGLU-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-THIN-SWIGLU-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-THIN-SWIGLU-PROVEN   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-THIN-SWIGLU-CODE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LUT-AND-MEMBER.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-RECURSION-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-THIN-SWIGLU-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LUT-AND-MEMBER.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-O1-LUT-LOOKUP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FLAT-DATA-MEMBER-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-RECURSION-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ZERO-RECURSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SUB-MICROSEC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-THIN-SWIGLU-PROOFS.
           IF WS-O1-LUT-LOOKUP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FLAT-DATA-MEMBER-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ZERO-RECURSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SUB-MICROSEC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-THIN-SWIGLU-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-THIN-SWIGLU-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-THIN-SWIGLU-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-THIN-SWIGLU-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-THIN-SWIGLU-CODE.
